    "updated_at": "2023-03-06T12:32:59Z",
    "body": "Love this!  I think it addresses one of the main reasons people have to resort to SPAs (aside from the elusive \"DX\"). Losing state when navigating across documents, whether it be iframe state or form state, makes MPAs a lot less attractive.\r\n\r\nI wonder if it can be an iframe attribute rather than a new type of element?",
